{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for QuizGenie', 'description': "Primary container for QuizGenie implementation: A React-based quiz app that generates multiple-choice questions using an LLM API (like Gemini or OpenAI) based on a user-entered topic. The app displays each question with 4 options, allows answer selection, shows explanations, and calculates the user's score. If the API call fails, it falls back to dummy data. The API key is stored securely in a .env file and used in fetch requests. The UI is clean, requires no login, and supports one topic per quiz session.", 'framework': 'express', 'platform': 'backend', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft backend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Topic-based Question Generation",\n      "description": "Generates multiple-choice questions using an LLM API based on a topic entered by the user.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Multiple Choice Interface",\n      "description": "Displays each question with 4 answer options and allows the user to select one.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Explanations",\n      "description": "Shows explanations for each question after the user answers.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Score Calculation",\n      "description": "Calculates and displays the user\'s score at the end of the quiz.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "API Fallback",\n      "description": "If the LLM API call fails, the app uses dummy data for the quiz.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Secure API Key Handling",\n      "description": "Stores the API key in a .env file and uses it securely in fetch requests.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Clean UI",\n      "description": "Presents a clean, modern interface with no login required.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Single Topic Per Session",\n      "description": "Supports one topic per quiz session as entered by the user.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "Express.js"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2563eb",\n    "secondary": "#f1f5f9",\n    "accent": "#fbbf24"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI starts with a centered input box for the user to enter a quiz topic and a \'Start Quiz\' button. After starting, each question is shown one at a time with 4 options as radio buttons. After selecting an answer, the explanation is shown below the options. At the end, the user\'s score is displayed with an option to restart. The layout uses a card-like container centered on the page with clear spacing and modern colors."\n}'}",
